        "notes": "My first power I will use is Threads of Fate. It helps me pocket your other team for 3 seconds which is not bad and it reminds me of Chain Boost (Any mode excluding Stadium Mercy Perk) where you link another pocket to a teammate. \n\nThreads of Fate will be the best for you to pocket your teammates in a offensive way, it's best to aim for 60% offensive beam but if the fight is heavy, you can heal bot since the healing also works while Chain Boost is only for damage boosting. \n\nMy builds will be 5% Weapon Power, 5% Attack Speed, and 25 Shields (it can help regenerate when healing a ally thanks to sympathetic recovery passive). Having both weapon power and attack speed will help me heal slightly more and battle Mercy with a small amount of ATK Speed.",
