        "cash_earned": 0,
        "created_at": "2025-07-17T08:11:31.687848+00:00",
        "notes": "Round 2 is where you want to increase your Weapon Power more but a small Cooldown Reduction but your res will reduce your cooldown from 30 to 28.5 seconds. \n\nYou do need 15,000 cash so you want to try to not die on the first round to gain some bounties/more credits. Survivability is where you can gain more cash. :3 \n\nIf you do not have enough cash, you do not have to get the 15% weapon power once since it is going to be 6,000 cash. You can get Advanced Nanobiotics for 4,000 cash (5% Weapon Power and gain 10% Attack Speed for 3s if you are healing an ally.) It will cost you 13,000 Credits but hey, it will be 2,000 credits less but 20% weapon power and 10% ATK speed as long you heal an ally with advanced nanobiotics equipped. \n\nIf you do have enough cash, then awesome! Let's do this!\nYou want to have Talon Modification Module (15% Weapon Power), Icy Coolant (10% Weapon Power and 5% Cooldown Reduction), and all the greens from the first round which totals up to 15,000 credits. \n\nHaving 30% Weapon Power will help you increase your healing from 60 HP per second to 78 HP per second with your staff. Keep that in mind that Stadium does have DPS Passive which reduces healing by 30% for 2 seconds (back to 60 HP per second) if you are getting targeted by DPS heroes. With 10% ATK Speed thanks to advanced nanobiotics for 3s, she can heal 85.8 hp per second since the effects stack on both WP and AS. \n\nLet's move on to Round 3!! :)",
