        "notes": "I'd like to run Triage Unit for my 3rd round for more healing due to dps passive that slows down my healing. \n\nIf you want to Battle Mercy with Valk or using Valkyrie that does heal and damage boost automatically, Crepuscular Circle would be the better option. \n\nCash cost will be 19,750 but there will be optional items listed but here are my builds for this 3rd round. You want to add Caduceus Ex for 10% Weapon Power and 33% Caduceus Staff Range which helps you not to get too close to a teammate if they are dangers ahead. \n\nIf you are lower than 19,750 cash, you do not need Icy Coolant and equip Caduceus Ex and it will save you up to 5,500 cash. If you have a little more of cash, you can add the green ones used on first and second round. \n\nIt helps me not to be in closer way to a teammate since Mercy's staff range is 15 meters for both healing and damage boost. Having 33% staff range provides me 19.95 meters (almost 20 meters) and increased weapon power.",
