        "notes": "This is where I would add the Crepuscular Circle power to have automatic healing and damage boost while using Valkyrie. It can also help you Battle Mercy since the healing and damage boosting is applied during your ultimate. \n\nThere are optional powers such are Triage Unit, Battle Medic (for Battle Mercy with Crepuscular Circle), and Renaissance (can be useful to battle or valk with Crepuscular Circle equipped in the last rounds).  \n\nThis seems pricy but we do need more weapon power LOL. It will be 40,500 credits.\n\nIf you do not have enough cash, remove Icy Coolant and add Aftermarket Firing Pin (10% AS and 5% Move Speed) for 3,750. Total will be now 38,750 credits and 60% WP \n\nThis is where you want to add Eye of the Spider (25% WP and 10% more DMG to opponents under 30% Life)\n\nWith 70% WP, she can heal from 60 to 102 HP per sec. 30% DPS Passive will be 71.4 HP per sec. Damage from 20 to 34 (37 DMG if under 30% Life thanks to Eye of the Spider).",
